cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper it implements (preferred-citation).
  If you use the bundled data sample, cite the paper too: the BCCC-UDP-QUIC-IDS-2025
  release asks for that citation under CC BY 4.0.
title: "FlowSentry: hierarchical UDP/QUIC intrusion detection with a tunable reject option"
type: software
authors:
